\newlabel{fig:triplet-overlay-a}{{3.12}{30}{Patch showing coastal wetland (mean approximation error $1.24$, above the dataset-wide mean of $0.91$). Errors are located over open water, consistent with the class-level pattern of Figure~\ref {fig:approx-error-class}}{figure.caption.23}{}}
