\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.14}{\ignorespaces Patch showing cropland (mean approximation error $0.90$). This real data shows the band misalignment that Equation~\eqref  {eq:misalign-l1a} models synthetically. The scalar mean approximation error for this patch ($0.90$) is close to the dataset-wide mean despite the heavy artifact: Equation~\eqref  {eq:approx-error} averages absolute per-band intensity differences and is insensitive to spatial/geometric coherence, so it under-represents local misalignment, which is a limitation of the metric. }}{31}{figure.caption.25}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:triplet-overlay-c}{{3.14}{31}{Patch showing cropland (mean approximation error $0.90$). This real data shows the band misalignment that Equation~\eqref {eq:misalign-l1a} models synthetically. The scalar mean approximation error for this patch ($0.90$) is close to the dataset-wide mean despite the heavy artifact: Equation~\eqref {eq:approx-error} averages absolute per-band intensity differences and is insensitive to spatial/geometric coherence, so it under-represents local misalignment, which is a limitation of the metric}{figure.caption.25}{}}
